message: "If you use this framework, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Inverse Value Canvas"
authors:
  - family-names: Nakatsugawa
    given-names: Masahiro
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3224-0103"
abstract: >-
  A conceptual framework that turns missing features or omitted elements from deficiencies
  into value for those harmed by their presence, in four steps: Missing, Harmed, Inverted
  Ally and Strategic Fit; used to convert absence into a strategic asset.
repository-code: "https://github.com/masahiroid/inverse-value-canvas"
keywords:
